Tue Nov 17 21:00:00 UTC 2026 - Denys <288736242+StDenis1980@users.noreply.github.com>

- Update to 0.6: when offline or a remote fails, try again after 30 s,
  then less often up to every 15 minutes (RestartSteps); on first boot
  the network was not up yet and Tinta Office arrived only after 16
  minutes (V2 VM test of Build10.19)

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Nov 17 12:10:00 UTC 2026 - Denys <288736242+StDenis1980@users.noreply.github.com>

- Update to 0.5: before installing, set Flatpak's languages to the ten
  of ADR 0009 (uk, en, es, pl, de, fr, it, ro, cs, lt), so Firefox and
  the other apps come with their translations; before, Flatpak took
  only en_US, the language of the first boot (VM test of Build15.6).

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Nov 17 10:00:00 UTC 2026 - Denys <288736242+StDenis1980@users.noreply.github.com>

- Update to 0.4: do not hold the boot (1 min 20 s in a VM): the service
  is Type=exec without After=network-online.target and waits for the
  network itself (nm-online, 5 minutes)
- Offline or a remote down is no longer a failed unit: exit 75, and
  systemd runs the script again 15 minutes later; a build without
  vilna.flatpakrepo exits 0 and Tinta Office waits for the next boot
- vilna.flatpakrepo is now Source5: a build without it fails (the
  Build15.6 image had no repository file, so Tinta never installed)

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Nov 16 21:10:00 UTC 2026 - Denys <288736242+StDenis1980@users.noreply.github.com>

- Update to 0.3: ship vilna.flatpakrepo with the public key of Vilna's
  Flatpak repository, so Tinta Office installs on first boot

